# Scope & Applicability

This TPRA applies to all external parties that:

- Process organisational data  
- Access organisational systems  
- Provide cloud or SaaS services  
- Provide AI/ML capabilities  
- Integrate via API  
- Provide managed services  
- Store, transmit, or process sensitive information  

Vendor categories include:

- SaaS platforms  
- Cloud service providers  
- AI/LLM vendors  
- Managed service providers  
- Offshore development teams  
- Sub‑processors  
- Open‑source dependencies 
